## 🧪 Use Case 7: Implement Auto-Save on DOM Changes

```js
const editor = document.getElementById('editor');
let autoSaveTimer;

const observer = new MutationObserver((mutations) => {
  // Clear previous timer
  clearTimeout(autoSaveTimer);

